 "path_redaction": "The absolute workspace prefix is replaced with <fixture-workspace> in tab-book-replay-scenarios.json (1 field), double-charge-scenarios.json (1 field) and excess-rent-sizes.json (5 fields). Their source and export hashes are distinct. Every other file listed under sources is byte-identical to the source commit. The traces are published as recorded: each one's program_artifacts section names the four program binaries by their absolute paths on the machine that ran it.",
 "source_files": "The nine files under source/foundation/onchain/ are the build inputs of this record that differ from the files under ../source/, copied byte for byte at the program_source commit. Their SHA-256 values equal the entries for the same paths in each branch trace's build_inputs. The other 67 build inputs are identical to files under ../source/. The files retain their existing copyright, and this release adds no license grant for them.",
 "not_published": "The source record at docs/evidence/tab-receipt-book-20261119 holds 69 traces of this build and 57 of the earlier programs; four and two are published here. The traces of the swap, Jupiter and Pump runs are among those not published. Also not published: the comparison of every earlier test module on both builds, the client test logs and traces, the local-validator runs, the build, unit-test and interface receipts and logs, and the other scenario files."
}
